{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SIGILLUM is a first-person survival horror videogame set in the history and culture of southern Spain.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/254b8a30ba66427705904927d2431bd1.poster.avif?t=1757428731\" width=1152 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/254b8a30ba66427705904927d2431bd1.webm?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/254b8a30ba66427705904927d2431bd1.mp4?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">'The streets have fallen into darkness, the <strong>disease</strong> has spread, and souls wander aimlessly. You must <strong>uncover the secrets</strong> behind the sudden emergence of this new threat, eliminating or hiding from the enemies that cross your path, seeking <strong>alternative routes</strong>, and solving <strong>puzzles</strong> that will allow you to continue the <strong>divine mission</strong>, with the ultimate goal of putting an end to the nightmare.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/8949740446be905f773bd5a81abc49f5.poster.avif?t=1757428731\" width=1152 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/8949740446be905f773bd5a81abc49f5.webm?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/8949740446be905f773bd5a81abc49f5.mp4?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-&gt; FACE THE DANGERS OF THE PLAGUE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Use the <strong>'Llamador'</strong> to fight the enemies standing in your path</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/fb94195922ec9052d42201664cdb330c.poster.avif?t=1757428731\" width=1152 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/fb94195922ec9052d42201664cdb330c.webm?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/fb94195922ec9052d42201664cdb330c.mp4?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-&gt; FAITHFUL REPRESENTATION OF THE CITY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore the streets of <strong>M\u00e1laga</strong>, a city with a mysterious and sinister background, recreated with great attention to detail.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/c5ef41a6b274faafc8923de6970f46b6.poster.avif?t=1757428731\" width=1152 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/c5ef41a6b274faafc8923de6970f46b6.webm?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/c5ef41a6b274faafc8923de6970f46b6.mp4?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-&gt; STYLE INSPIRED BY CLASSIC SURVIVAL HORROR</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The classic gameplay and artistic style are combined with polished animations to deliver a <strong>dynamic experience</strong> for the player.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/19562fd8d88567ca88b16527b98858c3.poster.avif?t=1757428731\" width=1152 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/19562fd8d88567ca88b16527b98858c3.webm?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/19562fd8d88567ca88b16527b98858c3.mp4?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-&gt; SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unravel the <strong>hidden riddles</strong> in the environment of those who still remain unseen to unlock new paths.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/525d53d432f1d2b638e8510e63129bb3.poster.avif?t=1757428731\" width=1152 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/525d53d432f1d2b638e8510e63129bb3.webm?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/525d53d432f1d2b638e8510e63129bb3.mp4?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-&gt; REALITY-INSPIRED NARRATIVE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SIGILLUM\u2019s storyline takes inspiration\u00a0from <strong>historical\u00a0events</strong> that took place\u00a0hundreds of years ago.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/4d200100bfe8fbdc65ba86b26fe4ef73.poster.avif?t=1757428731\" width=1152 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/4d200100bfe8fbdc65ba86b26fe4ef73.webm?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/4d200100bfe8fbdc65ba86b26fe4ef73.mp4?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Beware\u2026\u00a0<i>someone</i> is always watching you from the shadows.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/815770c432d13e877ad059accf3e27a9.poster.avif?t=1757428731\" width=1152 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/815770c432d13e877ad059accf3e27a9.webm?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/815770c432d13e877ad059accf3e27a9.mp4?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565390?t=1757428731","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565390?t=1757428731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/8744db515951adbde9cb928242993ccb427f4c29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757428731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/8744db515951adbde9cb928242993ccb427f4c29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757428731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"A first-person survival horror game that contains elements of violence and combat against hostile enemies. Players will use melee weapons such as daggers, hammers, and spears, as well as firearms, including pistols and shotguns, to defend themselves against the infected. Combat is primarily close-quarters, and enemies may release small amounts of blood when hit. The environment may feature scenes with corpses and visible bloodstains. When an enemy is defeated, their body will remain on the ground as part of the scene. Some in-game dialogue may include coarse language and mild profanity and Combat is a necessity for survival, not a glorification of harm. The religious theme is used as a narrative tool to enrich the context and atmosphere of the game. It is approached in a respectful and careful manner, with no intention to offend anyone, and is aligned with the cultural and historical setting of the city. The portrayal of religious elements is designed to be an integral part of the narrative, without promoting or criticizing any religious beliefs or practices."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SIGILLUM is a first-person survival horror videogame set in the history and culture of southern Spain.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/254b8a30ba66427705904927d2431bd1.poster.avif?t=1757428731\" width=1152 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/254b8a30ba66427705904927d2431bd1.webm?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/254b8a30ba66427705904927d2431bd1.mp4?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">'The streets have fallen into darkness, the <strong>disease</strong> has spread, and souls wander aimlessly. You must <strong>uncover the secrets</strong> behind the sudden emergence of this new threat, eliminating or hiding from the enemies that cross your path, seeking <strong>alternative routes</strong>, and solving <strong>puzzles</strong> that will allow you to continue the <strong>divine mission</strong>, with the ultimate goal of putting an end to the nightmare.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/8949740446be905f773bd5a81abc49f5.poster.avif?t=1757428731\" width=1152 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/8949740446be905f773bd5a81abc49f5.webm?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/8949740446be905f773bd5a81abc49f5.mp4?t=1757428731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-&gt; FACE THE DANGERS OF THE PLAGUE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Use the <strong>'Llamador'</strong> to fight the enemies standing in your path</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin